      "level": 2,
      "content": "6.3 Science & Technology"
    },
    {
      "id": "q83spxc",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "CSIR-IIIM (Indian Institute of Integrative Medicine): Jammu; research in medicinal plants, drug discovery; leading 'Aroma Mission'",
        "NIO (National Institute of Oceanography): Has collaborative research in Wular Lake",
        "DRDO Labs in J&amp;K: DIBER (Defence Institute of High Altitude Research) — Leh; altitude-specific research, high-altitude food, clothing",
        "ISRO: Telemetry &amp; tracking station at Lucknow doesn't cover J&amp;K directly, but ISRO satellite data used for J&amp;K agricultural planning",
        "BSNL &amp; Digital Connectivity: Government investing heavily in 4G/5G rollout; 'Digital J&amp;K' mission",
        "Aroma Mission: CSIR-IIIM initiative; promoting lavender, lemon grass cultivation in Jammu hills; farmer income supplement",
        "Purple Revolution: Associated with lavender cultivation in Bhaderwah (Doda district) and Ramban"
      ]
    },
